# Dota 2 Hero Guide - RAG Context

## Carry / Position 1

**Anti-Mage**
Goal: Farm faster than anyone via Blink mobility, burn mana to cripple casters, delete heroes with Mana Void, become unkillable late with Counterspell.
Requires: Safe farm for Battle Fury (before 16 min ideal), team willing to 4v5 while you accelerate, Manta timing for dispel and illusion pressure. Strong against int/mana-dependent lineups.
Fights: Split push until you have 2-3 items, then Blink onto isolated backline targets. Save Counterspell for big spells. Use Mana Void when enemies are low mana for max damage.
Don't: Fight early without core items, skip BFury for "fighting build", Blink aggressively into multiple heroes, pick into physical damage lineups that ignore mana burn.

**Arc Warden**
Goal: Create overwhelming map pressure with Tempest Double clone. Farm multiple locations, siege highground safely, win through item/economic advantage.
Requires: Micro skills for clone management, Midas timing, Gleipnir/Maelstrom for wave clear, understanding which items duplicate (Midas, BKB, Refresher).
Fights: Send clone in first to use items and test enemy reactions. Keep real hero safe. Use Magnetic Field for save, Spark Wraiths for zoning.
Don't: Send clone to die for nothing (it feeds gold), forget to use clone's items, pick into heavy gank lineups without vision.

**Chaos Knight**
Goal: Delete single targets with massive burst from Reality Rift + Chaos Bolt + illusion damage. Overwhelm with Phantasm illusions that hit like trucks.
Requires: Armlet toggling skill, mana management (very limited pool), single-target lockdown from team, BKB for teamfights.
Fights: Pop Phantasm before engaging, Reality Rift priority target into your illusions, Chaos Bolt for stun. BKB and run at backline.
Don't: Spam spells (you'll be oom in 2 rotations), fight without Phantasm, pick into AoE clear (Earthshaker, Leshrac, Sven).

**Drow Ranger**
Goal: Dominate from range with massive Marksmanship agility, enable ranged allies with precision aura, kite melees who can't close the gap.
Requires: Positioning discipline (Marksmanship disables when enemies close), Hurricane Pike for self-peel, team to frontline for you.
Fights: Stay max range, use Gust to push away divers, Pike yourself away if jumped. Never frontline. Frost Arrows to kite.
Don't: Let enemies get on top of you (lose ult), pick into gap-closers (Storm, Slark, PA) without counters, frontline ever.

**Faceless Void**
Goal: Win teamfights with Chronosphere - catch multiple enemies while your team kills them inside. Scale with attack speed and bash procs.
Requires: Chrono timing and placement (practice in demo), MoM or Maelstrom for farming, BKB vs heavy disable, team coordination.
Fights: Wait for enemies to clump, Blink/Time Walk in, Chrono 2-3 priority targets. Time Walk out if Chrono is bad. Let ranged allies shoot in.
Don't: Chrono your own team (classic throw), use Chrono for single support kills, Time Walk forward then have no escape.

**Gyrocopter**
Goal: Deal massive AoE physical and magical damage in teamfights. Flash farm with Flak Cannon, dominate early-mid with Rocket Barrage and Call Down.
Requires: Early aggression with Rocket Barrage (700 damage at close range), Flak Cannon for farming and fighting, positioning for multi-hero Flak.
Fights: Call Down to start, Rocket Barrage if you can get close, Flak Cannon from safe distance. Position to hit multiple heroes with Flak bounces.
Don't: Pick expecting late-game dominance (falls off), use Flak to farm when fight is imminent, ignore Rocket Barrage range requirement.

**Juggernaut**
Goal: Win lane with Blade Fury kill threat, sustain team with Healing Ward, delete heroes with Omnislash, scale with crit.
Requires: Understanding Blade Fury makes you magic immune but can't attack during, Healing Ward micro, Omnislash when enemy isolated.
Fights: Blade Fury through disables to get close, Omnislash isolated targets (not into creeps), keep Healing Ward alive and moving.
Don't: Blade Fury then walk away (commit to kills), let Healing Ward die, Omnislash into creep waves, use Fury just for damage when you could right-click.

**Lifestealer**
Goal: Sustain through fights with Feast lifesteal, shred tanks with %HP damage, surprise initiate with Infest, ignore disables with Rage.
Requires: Target selection (Feast wrecks high-HP heroes), Infest bomb coordination with initiators (Storm, Spirit Breaker), Rage timing.
Fights: Infest ally initiator, pop out after they go in, Rage through disables, hit the highest HP target for max Feast value.
Don't: Pick into kiting lineups (no gap close), Rage too early wasting duration walking, Infest squishy supports.

**Luna**
Goal: Farm extremely fast with Moon Glaives, win teamfights with Eclipse nuke, enable team with Lunar Blessing aura, melt buildings.
Requires: Early farming acceleration, Manta for illusion glaive bounces, BKB to channel Eclipse safely, glaive bounce positioning.
Fights: Eclipse when enemies grouped (damage splits), BKB and right-click with Glaives bouncing. Position for max bounce value.
Don't: Eclipse single targets, fight at night without vision (you're squishy), clump your illusions (glaives need spread).

**Medusa**
Goal: Become unkillable late with Mana Shield, win fights with Stone Gaze, farm fast with Split Shot, stat-stack with items.
Requires: Extreme farming patience (needs 3+ major items), Mana Shield mana management, Stone Gaze timing when enemies commit.
Fights: Stand in the middle of everything, Stone Gaze when enemies commit and face you, tank with Mana Shield, Split Shot everyone.
Don't: Fight early (you're food without items), waste Stone Gaze, pick into mana burn (AM destroys you).

**Monkey King**
Goal: Dominate lane with Jingu Mastery stacks, get pickoffs with Boundless Strike stun, win teamfights with Wukong's Command ring.
Requires: Lane dominance to stack Jingu (4 hits = massive damage), tree positioning, Wukong's placement in chokes, Echo Sabre.
Fights: Get Jingu stacks then Boundless Strike for huge damage, Wukong's in chokepoints so enemies can't escape ring easily.
Don't: Get knocked out of trees (stunned + damage), waste Boundless Strike without Jingu buff, place Wukong's where enemies walk out.

**Morphling**
Goal: Be impossible to kill with Attribute Shift, burst targets by Morphing into them and using their spells, sustain with high agi.
Requires: Mastery of Attribute Shift (survival vs damage balance), understanding every hero's spells for Morph targets, E-Blade for burst.
Fights: Morph into high-impact target, use their spells, Morph back. Attribute Shift to agi for damage, shift str when taking heat. Waveform to disjoint.
Don't: Get stunlocked at low str (instant death), Morph into useless targets, shift full agi without escape plan.

**Naga Siren**
Goal: Dominate the map with illusion split push, trap enemies with Ensnare, control fights with Song of the Siren, scale with Rip Tide armor reduction.
Requires: Illusion micro for split push, Radiance or Diffusal timing, Song coordination with team (don't heal enemies), cut waves behind towers.
Fights: Song to setup or disengage (NOT when team is killing), Ensnare priority targets (pierces BKB), illusions spread for Rip Tide procs.
Don't: Song when team is about to kill someone (heals them), send illusions to die without purpose, pick into AoE clear.

**Phantom Assassin**
Goal: Delete heroes with massive Coup de Grace crits, snowball with early kills, become evasive nightmare with Blur.
Requires: Desolator or Battle Fury timing, Blur awareness (disappears from minimap), BKB for teamfights, target selection.
Fights: Blink Strike to backline, BKB, pray for crits. Dagger to slow runners. Blur makes you hard to see coming.
Don't: Pick into MKB/break carriers, forget Dagger applies attack modifiers (Deso, lifesteal), dive without Blink Strike.

**Phantom Lancer**
Goal: Overwhelm with illusion army from Juxtapose, drain mana with Doppelganger and Diffusal, become impossible to identify among illusions.
Requires: Diffusal Blade timing, Doppelganger use for dispel and dodge, constant illusion generation through attacking.
Fights: Create chaos with illusions everywhere, Doppelganger to dodge big spells and dispel, burn their mana so they can't cast.
Don't: Pick into AoE (Earthshaker, Leshrac, Sven), clump illusions, use Doppel offensively when you need escape.

**Slark**
Goal: Snowball by stealing stats with Essence Shift, purge disables with Dark Pact, be impossible to catch with Shadow Dance and Pounce.
Requires: Target isolation for stat stacking, Dark Pact timing (purge after stuns land, not before), Shadow Dance awareness.
Fights: Pounce priority target, Dark Pact to purge their stuns, steal stats, Shadow Dance when you need regen or to know if seen.
Don't: Dark Pact too early (purges before stuns apply), Pounce predictably, fight into AoE stuns, ignore Shadow Dance passive.

**Spectre**
Goal: Scale infinitely with Desolate and Dispersion, haunt into any fight globally, chase with Spectral Dagger pathing.
Requires: Surviving lane phase, Radiance timing, Haunt usage for kills AND farming (illusion on every enemy), tank items for Dispersion.
Fights: Haunt when fight starts to be everywhere at once, Reality to the best target, Dagger for pathing and slow, tank damage for Dispersion.
Don't: Haunt for single support kills (huge CD), fight early without items, forget Spectral Dagger gives terrain pathing.

**Sven**
Goal: One-shot teams with God's Strength cleave, stun groups with Storm Hammer, farm ancients with Great Cleave.
Requires: BKB (you get kited hard), Blink or Shadow Blade for initiation, Echo Sabre for burst, understanding cleave geometry.
Fights: God's Strength, BKB, Blink in, Storm Hammer clump, cleave everyone down. Hit the hero in front to cleave backline.
Don't: Pop God's Strength then get kited whole duration, initiate without team follow-up, skip BKB.

**Templar Assassin**
Goal: Dominate mid with Refraction, burst heroes with Meld strike and Psi Blades spill, control map with Traps.
Requires: Refraction charge management, Meld positioning for armor reduction, Trap placement on runes/paths, Blink for Meld initiation, Deso.
Fights: Blink behind target, Meld strike for armor reduction, Psi Blades through them to hit backline. Traps for slow/vision.
Don't: Let Refraction get stripped by DoTs (Veno, Viper destroy you), miss Psi Blades spill, pick into break carriers.

**Terrorblade**
Goal: Highest armor and illusion damage in game. Farm insanely fast with Metamorphosis ranged form, Sunder to survive burst, Reflection to slow.
Requires: Metamorphosis timing (use for farming AND fighting), Sunder awareness (can target allies to save them), illusion micro.
Fights: Metamorphosis, send illusions in, Sunder when you get low (swap HP with enemy or ally), Reflection to slow their carry.
Don't: Fight without Metamorphosis, Sunder too late (if stunlocked can't cast), pick into AoE magic damage (low HP pool).

**Troll Warlord**
Goal: Highest attack speed in game with Fervor and Battle Trance. Perma-bash targets, sustain with Battle Trance status resist.
Requires: Fervor stack management (don't switch targets), Battle Trance timing for surviving burst and committing, BKB.
Fights: Commit to one target, build Fervor stacks, Battle Trance when you need to survive or finish, ranged form to chase.
Don't: Switch targets and lose Fervor stacks, Battle Trance when already dead, forget ranged axes slow and melee axes root.

**Ursa**
Goal: Stack Fury Swipes to deal massive damage to single targets, delete Roshan early, burst with Overpower + Enrage.
Requires: Gap closing (Blink or Abyssal), Enrage timing for damage reduction, Roshan timing (can solo at 10-15 min with lifesteal).
Fights: Blink in, Overpower, stack Fury Swipes on one target, Enrage when you take damage for reduction. Don't switch targets.
Don't: Get kited (your weakness), switch targets (lose stacks), Enrage too early, forget Overpower can prep before fight.

**Weaver**
Goal: Be unkillable with Shukuchi invis and Time Lapse, deal double attacks with Geminate, shred armor with The Swarm.
Requires: Time Lapse timing (rewinds 5 seconds - track your HP mentally), Shukuchi max MS for chasing/escaping, attack speed.
Fights: Shukuchi in, attack, Shukuchi out, Time Lapse if things go wrong. The Swarm for armor reduction and vision.
Don't: Time Lapse when last 5 seconds were also bad, pick into AoE disable, Shukuchi directly into enemies predictably.

**Wraith King** (skeleton_king)
Goal: Refuse to die with Reincarnation, crit with Mortal Strike, lifesteal with Vampiric Spirit skeletons, stun with Wraithfire Blast.
Requires: Mana for Reincarnation (key), Armlet toggling, Radiance for skeleton army, Blink for initiation.
Fights: Blink stun priority target, right-click with skeletons, die, Reincarnate, keep fighting. Slow aura on Reincarnation helps.
Don't: Run out of mana (no Reincarnation = you just die), pick into AM/Diffusal mana burn.


## Mid / Position 2

**Alchemist**
Goal: Farm faster than any hero with Greevil's Greed, become 12-slotted (give Aghs to teammates), tank with Chemical Rage regen.
Requires: Uncontested farm (team creates space), Radiance timing, Aghs gifting priority decisions, Chemical Rage during fights.
Fights: Chemical Rage before engaging (not after), tank with insane regen, Acid Spray for armor reduction, Concoction stun.
Don't: Fight without Chemical Rage, farm jungle when lanes available, gift Aghs before your core items.

**Batrider**
Goal: Initiate by dragging priority targets with Flaming Lasso into your team, dominate lane with Sticky Napalm stacks, scout with Firefly.
Requires: Blink for Lasso initiation, Napalm stack management in lane, Firefly pathing over trees for escape.
Fights: Blink in, Lasso priority target, Firefly and drag them back to team. Napalm stacks amplify all damage.
Don't: Lasso without team nearby (can't kill solo), Firefly and then walk on ground, skip Blink.

**Bloodseeker**
Goal: Snowball with Thirst MS/damage from low HP enemies, silence runners with Blood Rite, punish movement with Rupture.
Requires: Map awareness for Thirst (see low HP enemies globally), Rupture target selection, Blood Rite placement prediction.
Fights: Rupture mobile hero (they can't run), Blood Rite where they'll stand, Thirst gives you speed as enemies get low.
Don't: Rupture targets with blinks that don't require movement, ignore Bloodrage amp works BOTH ways (you take more damage).

**Broodmother**
Goal: Take over a lane completely with Spiderlings, solo kill heroes with Insatiable Hunger, become unkillable with Spin Web MS/regen.
Requires: Lane where you can dominate (pick after seeing enemy offlane), Spiderling micro, Spin Web network management.
Fights: Stay in Web network, Insatiable Hunger for sustain and damage, swarm with Spiderlings. Silken Bolo pierces spell immunity.
Don't: Pick into AoE (Axe, ES, LC, Leshrac), feed Spiderlings (they give gold), leave your Web network.

**Death Prophet**
Goal: Siege towers and win fights with Exorcism spirits, sustain with Spirit Siphon, push early timing windows.
Requires: Exorcism timing (long CD, commit when up), Spirit Siphon targets (more = more heal), Eul's for setup, tanky items.
Fights: Exorcism, run at enemies so spirits hit, Spirit Siphon multiple targets, Silence key casters. Don't run away from enemies.
Don't: Fight without Exorcism, run away during Exorcism (spirits need to hit), pick when you can't end before 40 min.

**Dragon Knight**
Goal: Tank everything with Dragon Blood regen/armor, stun with Dragon Tail, gain range and AoE with Elder Dragon Form, take towers.
Requires: Elder Dragon Form management (push and fight when up), BKB for teamfights, Blink for initiation, Soul Ring for mana.
Fights: Elder Dragon Form, Blink stun, tank everything, corrosive breath for tower push. Extended Dragon Tail range in dragon form.
Don't: Fight without Elder Dragon Form if avoidable, pick expecting flashy outplays (you're straightforward).

**Ember Spirit**
Goal: Global mobility with Fire Remnants, AoE magic damage with Sleight + Chains/Flameguard, scale with spell amp or cleave.
Requires: Remnant management (always have one safe), Sleight timing for chain combos, decision between magic or physical build.
Fights: Keep a Remnant safe, Sleight in for damage, Chains to root, Remnant out. Flame Guard for shield. Global mobility.
Don't: Use all Remnants aggressively (no escape), pick into Silences without dispel ready, forget Sleight dodges everything.

**Huskar**
Goal: Dominate HP-based matchups with Burning Spears, dive with Berserker's Blood attack speed/regen at low HP, delete targets with Life Break.
Requires: Armlet for toggling at low HP, Life Break target selection, lane dominance, knowing your limits at various HP levels.
Fights: Life Break in, Armlet toggle at low HP for Berserker's Blood bonuses, Burning Spears stack damage. You're stronger at low HP.
Don't: Pick into pure/physical burst (you want magic damage to resist), Life Break without kill potential.

**Invoker**
Goal: Have an answer for everything with 10 spells. Scale infinitely, control fights with Tornado/EMP/Meteor/Deafening Blast.
Requires: Spell memorization, Quas/Wex vs Exort decision, combo execution, invoke timing, extensive practice.
Fights: Tornado to setup, EMP for mana drain, Meteor + Deafening Blast combo, Cold Snap for lockdown, Alacrity your carry.
Don't: Panic-invoke wrong spells, forget Alacrity on carry, use Tornado at wrong time (lifts enemies away from spells).

**Kunkka**
Goal: One-shot clumped enemies with Tidebringer cleave, combo with X Marks + Torrent + Ghostship for guaranteed damage.
Requires: X Mark combo timing (X, wait, Torrent, wait, return, Ghostship), Tidebringer positioning to cleave backline.
Fights: X someone, Torrent where they'll return, Ghostship on top, Tidebringer cleave. Rum buff delays damage on allies.
Don't: Miss Torrent without X combo, forget X Marks can save allies, Tidebringer the tank when carry is behind them.

**Leshrac**
Goal: Constant AoE damage with Pulse Nova, stun with Split Earth, demolish towers with Diabolic Edict, dominate lane with Lightning Storm.
Requires: Bloodstone for Pulse Nova sustain, Split Earth setup (Eul's), tank items to survive in melee range.
Fights: Pulse Nova on, run at everyone, Split Earth to stun, Lightning Storm spam. Diabolic Edict shreds isolated targets.
Don't: Toggle Pulse Nova without mana, miss Split Earth (it's slow), fight without Pulse Nova mana.

**Lina**
Goal: Burst heroes with Laguna Blade, stack Fiery Soul for attack speed, stun with Light Strike Array, scale into right-clicks late.
Requires: LSA landing (Eul's setup helps), Fiery Soul stack maintenance, decision between magic burst or attack build.
Fights: LSA stun (Eul's setup if needed), Dragon Slave, Laguna Blade to finish. Keep Fiery Soul stacks for attack speed.
Don't: Miss Light Strike Array, waste Laguna on tanky heroes (want to delete squishies), let stacks drop.

**Lone Druid**
Goal: Two-hero power with Spirit Bear, demolish towers with Demolish, adapt with True Form transformation.
Requires: Bear micro, bear item builds (tanky or damage), Savage Roar for disengage, knowing when ranged vs True Form.
Fights: Bear attacks while you stay safe, Savage Roar to fear enemies away, True Form when you need to tank.
Don't: Let the bear die (you're half a hero), forget bear Entangle procs, wander without your bear.

**Lycan**
Goal: End games fast with push and Shapeshift MS, summon wolves for scouting and damage, amplify summons with Howl.
Requires: Wolves micro for scouting/stacking, Shapeshift timing for kills and escapes, push-focused item build, ending before 30 min.
Fights: Shapeshift for haste and crit, Howl to amp all summon damage, wolves provide vision and DPS.
Don't: Pick expecting late-game scaling, ignore wolf scouting, let games go long (you fall off).

**Magnus**
Goal: Win teamfights with Reverse Polarity into Skewer combo, buff carry with Empower cleave, farm fast with Shockwave.
Requires: Blink for RP, Skewer awareness and positioning, Empower on the right carry, RP patience (wait for good ones).
Fights: Blink RP 2-3 heroes, Skewer them into team, Shockwave. Keep Empower on your carry always.
Don't: Panic RP on one hero (wait for 2-3), Skewer enemies away from your team, forget Empower during downtime.

**Meepo**
Goal: End games at 25-30 min with XP advantage from clones, permastun with Earthbind, burst with Poof, global presence.
Requires: Micro skills for all Meepos, Earthbind chain timing, Poof positioning, keeping all Meepos healthy.
Fights: Net to root, Poof all Meepos onto target, keep chain-netting. Spread Meepos in fights to avoid AoE.
Don't: Let any Meepo die (you all die), pick into AoE (Earthshaker, Sven, Lich), clump Meepos.

**Necrophos** (necrolyte)
Goal: Win fights of attrition with Heartstopper Aura and Death Pulse sustain, execute with Reaper's Scythe (adds respawn time).
Requires: Staying alive in fights for Sadist stacks, Scythe timing (want to kill not just damage), frontline items.
Fights: Stay in the middle, Death Pulse constantly for heal and damage, Heartstopper Aura burns them down, Scythe low HP targets.
Don't: Scythe tanky heroes at high HP (it's %missing HP damage), pick into burst that kills you before you heal.

**Outworld Destroyer** (obsidian_destroyer)
Goal: Steal int with Arcane Orb, imprison key targets with Astral Imprisonment, nuke with Sanity's Eclipse based on int difference.
Requires: Int stacking items, Astral timing for saves or setup, Sanity's Eclipse when int difference is high, auto-attack focus.
Fights: Arcane Orb to steal int, Astral to save ally or setup, Sanity's Eclipse when you have big int advantage.
Don't: Astral enemies when team is trying to kill them, Sanity's Eclipse without int advantage.

**Pangolier**
Goal: Initiate and escape with Rolling Thunder, chain stuns with Shield Crash and Swashbuckle, scale with Lucky Shot procs.
Requires: Rolling Thunder control (bouncing off walls), Swashbuckle vector targeting, Shield Crash stacking, Diffusal.
Fights: Roll in bouncing off terrain for multi-stuns, Swashbuckle through enemies, Shield Crash for damage reduction.
Don't: Roll into bad positions, forget Rolling Thunder stuns on contact AND terrain bounces.

**Puck**
Goal: Elusive playmaker with Phase Shift and Illusory Orb jukes, silence with Waning Rift, control fights with Dream Coil leash.
Requires: Orb jaunt timing, Phase Shift dodge reactions, Dream Coil placement, Blink for initiation.
Fights: Orb in, Waning Rift silence, Dream Coil to leash, Phase Shift to dodge, Orb out. Extremely slippery.
Don't: Jaunt into danger, break your own Dream Coil by killing targets, Phase Shift too late.

**Queen of Pain**
Goal: High-mobility burst mage with Blink and Sonic Wave, dominate lane with Shadow Strike, constant repositioning.
Requires: Blink usage for aggression AND escape, Sonic Wave angles for multi-hero hits, Shadow Strike harass.
Fights: Blink in, Scream, Sonic Wave through multiple heroes, Blink out (or BKB and stay).
Don't: Blink in without Blink back available, miss Sonic Wave on grouped enemies, pick into magic resist stackers.

**Razor**
Goal: Drain enemy carry's damage with Static Link, force fights around you with Eye of the Storm and Plasma Field.
Requires: Static Link on the right target and maintaining it, Eye of the Storm uptime, frontline positioning.
Fights: Link their carry, don't break the link, Eye of the Storm on, tank everything. You have their damage now.
Don't: Link the support instead of carry, break Link by walking away, pick into kiting.

**Shadow Fiend** (nevermore)
Goal: Farm fast with triple Raze, dominate mid with Necromastery souls, burst with Requiem of Souls, armor reduction aura.
Requires: Raze accuracy, Necromastery soul collection (don't die - lose half), Requiem timing, Eul's or BKB for setup.
Fights: Eul's yourself, Requiem while landing, Raze combo. Or BKB Requiem. Presence aura helps whole team.
Don't: Die and lose souls, miss Razes, Requiem at range (more souls = more damage up close).

**Silencer**
Goal: Punish spell usage with Arcane Curse, int steal with Glaives and Last Word, ruin teamfights with Global Silence.
Requires: Global Silence timing (save for key spells like Black Hole), Glaives management, Last Word on channelers.
Fights: Wait for enemy to commit big spells then Global Silence, or Global preemptively to stop initiation. Int steal is permanent.
Don't: Global too early (enemies wait it out), ignore permanent int steal scaling.

**Skywrath Mage**
Goal: Delete single targets with Mystic Flare, Ancient Seal silence and amp, spam Arcane Bolt, punish immobile heroes.
Requires: Rod of Atos or teammate lockdown for Mystic Flare, mana sustain, Ancient Seal on priority targets.
Fights: Ancient Seal (amps magic damage), Concussive Shot slow, Mystic Flare on rooted/stunned target. Need setup.
Don't: Mystic Flare without setup (enemies walk out), pick into BKB rushers.

**Sniper**
Goal: Dominate from extreme range with Take Aim, zone with Shrapnel, execute with Assassinate, proc Headshot ministuns.
Requires: Positioning (you die instantly if caught), Hurricane Pike for self-peel, Shrapnel zoning.
Fights: Stay maximum range, Shrapnel zones, Assassinate fleeing targets. Pike yourself away if jumped.
Don't: Frontline ever, pick into gap closers without team protection.

**Storm Spirit**
Goal: Infinite mobility with Ball Lightning, zip around fights, catch isolated targets, scale with mana pool.
Requires: Ball Lightning mana management, Orchid/Bloodthorn timing for pickoffs, knowing your mana limits.
Fights: Zip in, Orchid target, combo, zip to next target or out. Calculate mana before committing.
Don't: Ball Lightning without mana calculation (stranded = dead), pick into mana burn or silence.

**Tinker**
Goal: Be everywhere with Boots of Travel rearm, spam nukes with Rearm, never let enemies push with March of the Machines.
Requires: BoT timing, Rearm combos, tree hiding for TP, constant map pressure, Blink for positioning.
Fights: Blink in, Laser/Rockets, Rearm, repeat. Defense Matrix for saves. March to zone. TP out.
Don't: TP to same spot repeatedly (predictable), Rearm without mana, pick into long-range initiation.

**Viper**
Goal: Win any 1v1 with Nethertoxin break and damage, chase with Poison Attack slow, zone with Corrosive Skin.
Requires: Nethertoxin on passive-dependent heroes, lane dominance, Dragon Lance for range.
Fights: Nethertoxin under enemy (breaks passives), Poison Attack slow, Viper Strike for slow. Very oppressive 1v1.
Don't: Pick and then play passive (you win lanes), forget Nethertoxin disables passives.

**Visage**
Goal: Burst with Soul Assumption stacks, dominate with Familiar summons, tank with Gravekeeper's Cloak layers.
Requires: Familiar micro (stun requires landing), Soul Assumption timing (need damage in area first), Cloak management.
Fights: Familiars dive and stun, Soul Assumption when stacks are up, Cloak layers make you tanky.
Don't: Let Familiars die (3 hits and dead, long CD), miss Familiar stuns, ignore Soul Assumption damage.

**Void Spirit**
Goal: Slippery magic damage dealer with multiple escapes and remnants, burst with Resonant Pulse shield and Aether Remnant pulls.
Requires: Remnant placement for escapes AND damage, Astral Step charge management, Dissimilate timing.
Fights: Aether Remnant to pull, Resonant Pulse for shield and damage, Astral Step to chase/escape, Dissimilate to dodge.
Don't: Use all Astral Step charges offensively, forget Dissimilate invulnerability.

**Zeus** (zuus)
Goal: Global damage and vision with Thundergod's Wrath, spam Arc Lightning for farm, burst with Lightning Bolt, reveal invis.
Requires: Nimbus placement for teamfights, Thundergod's timing for kills or vision, Bolt for invis detection.
Fights: Nimbus in fight area, spam Bolt and Arc Lightning, Thundergod's Wrath to finish low HP heroes globally.
Don't: Thundergod's at start of fight (want to finish low HP heroes), forget Bolt and Wrath reveal invis.


## Offlane / Position 3

**Axe**
Goal: Force enemies to attack you with Berserker's Call, spin to win with Counter Helix procs, execute with Culling Blade, cut waves.
Requires: Blink for Call initiation, lane cutting to disrupt carry farm, Blade Mail synergy, Call into Cull combo.
Fights: Blink into multiple enemies, Call them, spin procs while Blade Mail reflects, Culling Blade threshold kills.
Don't: Call one support (want multiple or carry), Blade Mail without being focused, pick into magic damage (Helix needs attacks).

**Beastmaster**
Goal: Control map with Hawk vision, initiate with Primal Roar piercing stun, push with summons, Inner Beast aura.
Requires: Hawk micro for scouting, Roar target selection, boar slow usage, Aghs for AoE stun if ahead.
Fights: Roar priority target (pierces BKB), boars slow everyone, Hawks for vision. Inner Beast helps whole team.
Don't: Let Hawks die (they give gold), Roar the support instead of carry, forget boar slow stacks.

**Brewmaster**
Goal: Win fights with Primal Split elemental pandas, setup with Cinder Brew slow and amp, Thunder Clap slow.
Requires: Primal Split micro (Cyclone enemy carry, Dispel ally, Haze important target), Cinder Brew combos.
Fights: Thunder Clap to slow, Cinder Brew for damage amp, Primal Split when focused. Micro pandas to control fight.
Don't: Die before Primal Split, forget Cinder Brew increases damage taken, waste Cyclone on wrong target.

**Bristleback**
