Fights: Skeleton Walk to position, Strafe + Burning Barrage for burst, Searing Arrows for sustained damage. Death Pact big creep for stats.
Don't: Walk around visible (you're squishy), forget Death Pact before fights, fight without Strafe available.

**Tiny**
Goal: Burst combo with Avalanche + Toss, massive right-click damage with Tree Grab cleave, take towers fast with Grow.
Requires: Avalanche-Toss combo (Toss during Avalanche for double damage), Tree Grab uptime, Blink for initiation.
Fights: Blink in, Avalanche-Toss combo (insane burst), Tree Grab cleave to hit multiple. Grow gives huge damage and armor.
Don't: Miss Avalanche-Toss combo (Toss during Avalanche), forget Tree Grab has charges, fight without tree.

**Razor**
Goal: Drain enemy carry's damage with Static Link, force fights around you with Eye of the Storm and Plasma Field.
Requires: Static Link on the right target and maintaining it, Eye of the Storm uptime, frontline positioning.
Fights: Link their carry (don't break it), Eye of the Storm on, Plasma Field for AoE damage. You have their damage now.
Don't: Link the support instead of carry, break Link by walking away, pick into kiting.

**Necrophos** (necrolyte)
Goal: Win fights of attrition with Heartstopper Aura and Death Pulse sustain, execute with Reaper's Scythe (adds respawn time).
Requires: Staying alive in fights for Sadist stacks, Scythe timing (want to kill not just damage), frontline items.
Fights: Stay in the middle, Death Pulse constantly, Heartstopper Aura burns them, Scythe low HP targets for kill + respawn penalty.
Don't: Scythe tanky heroes at high HP (it's %missing HP damage), pick into burst.